將room_seed,rooms_settings放到專案根目錄

在根目錄打開cmd 分別輸入以下四行 並將apikey替換成你的apikey

建立索引

curl.exe -X POST "http://127.0.0.1:7700/indexes" -H "Authorization: Bearer 你的apikey" -H "Content-Type: application/json" --data "{\"uid\": \"rooms\", \"primaryKey\": \"room_id\"}"

導入資料

curl.exe -X POST "http://127.0.0.1:7700/indexes/rooms/documents" -H "Authorization: Bearer 你的apikey" -H "Content-Type: application/json" --data-binary "@rooms_seed.json"

搜尋設定

curl.exe -X PATCH "http://127.0.0.1:7700/indexes/rooms/settings" -H "Authorization: Bearer 你的apikey" -H "Content-Type: application/json" --data-binary "@rooms_settings.json"

同義字

curl.exe -X PUT "http://127.0.0.1:7700/indexes/rooms/settings/synonyms" -H "Authorization: Bearer 你的apikey" -H "Content-Type: application/json" --data-binary "@synonyms.json"

在appsettings加入連線字串

"Meilisearch": {
    "Url": "http://127.0.0.1:7700",
    "ApiKey": "你的apikey"
  },


